msgctxt "IncrementalResearch.STRINGS.UI.TUTORIAL.STAGE6_BODY"
msgid "The colony has shifted often enough to form schools of thought. At each paradigm shift you can now choose a school for the next cycle: each favors some tiers of facilities over others. You may also choose none."
msgstr "パラダイムシフトを何度も重ねて、コロニーに学派が生まれました。これからは、シフトのたびに次の周回の学派を選べます。学派ごとに、得意な階層の設備が違います。学派を選ばなくても構いません。"
